{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_08_end","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_08","title":"告别往昔","storyCode":"CV-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"e11e673b5c82ae770d7747a2133d6c37c18b00441f5c47a61f87134da9d7b464","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"杰西卡看着远处越来越多的黑钢车队正缓缓驶来，在漫天的大雪中向天鸣铳。伍德洛也在黑钢本舰上对克里夫射出了那颗迟来的子弹。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡小姐的踪迹已经在掌握中......因为有命令在，底下的佣兵难免束手束脚的，不过算算时间，她的弹药差不多也要耗尽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂拉那边有消息吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜女士和矿工带着钱进了能源塔......两人都没有出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在众目睽睽下消失吗？那里肯定有其他的出路，告诉蒂拉继续搜寻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪呢？他离开了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生......他没有离开地块，看样子他似乎放弃了原本定下的逃脱计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟一开始据蒂拉报告，伍德洛先生打算在一切结束后带那位矿工先生躲进深山中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪往哪里去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他......正朝这边来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要派人拦截吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，让他来吧，如果他执意要来，没人能够阻拦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g2_mine_ruined"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇，前面有燃烧的障碍物，车子开不进去，我们只能下来步行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些是......黑钢的载具？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是伍德洛先生......还是杰西卡她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少说明刚刚能源塔爆炸时，不是所有人都在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，雷蛇......上面有消息来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各小组注意，现在的情况是，在方才的爆炸事故中目标工程师生死不明，目标海伦娜失踪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上级指令，放弃目标伍德洛，全力追捕目标杰西卡，目标在矿厂东部废弃巷道内，持有大量武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雷蛇，我们......该怎么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总有些事情我们能做，这片矿厂，我们比其他小队都熟悉，想想......怎么能以最快的速度赶到她的身边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来得比我预想中要快些......伍迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一路上，所有建筑都空无一人，我也只能来找你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在怪我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不该吗？有时，人们背负上恶孽不是因为做了什么，而是因为什么也没做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几十年前你就该射出子弹，伍迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你落荒而逃了，为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我的共感在长久的沉寂后，终于他妈意识到，我身边再次出现了萨科塔，也就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时可是一团糟，伍迪，与我共感一定不太好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，萨科塔的天性......我们总是共享一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和从你脑袋里共感到的玩意相比，战俘营里的遭遇可能还真算不上什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是残忍啊，伍迪，你这样痛恨我，但我的痛苦却无法取悦你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g8_abandonedblock"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"汇报，我看到杰西卡了，坐标已共享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目标正向矿厂外移动，身上携有一架重型能源炮、半自动冲锋铳......还有一把手铳，型号不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她一个人背了这么多吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了，她还背了一扇重盾，必要时可以变成炮架的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是厉害，看来我们的大小姐过了这么多年，变得还挺......不简单的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她怎么样，攻击性强吗？一些末路穷途的劫匪很容易一惊一乍，随便做点什么就能让他跳脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......看起来，她挺安静的，就那么向前走，什么也没有做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小巷中，女孩背着武器吃力地在风雪中向前方行进，道路两旁残败的墙群从她身侧缓缓后退。\n直到一个分岔路口，她在那里呆住了片刻，然后捏了捏领口，转向了需要逆风才能前行的那条道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在战俘营里的时间是静止的，但在外面，战争仍在继续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，伍迪，你和他被俘虏后，我带着更多的人去了更广阔的战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一月份顶着炮火渡河，八月份又得守在滚烫的沙漠里寸步不能退让。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时夺取胜利，就踏着敌人的尸体前进，有时战况失利，就踩着队友的尸体回撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有时，情况更糟，我不得不牺牲一些，保全另一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你对我和他做过的那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我做了无数次，不仅仅对你们，也对其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是战争摆在我面前的东西，看似是个选择，但其实是不可忤逆的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是选了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，不选就要前功尽弃，然后一败涂地，所以我选择接受规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到曾经深深仰慕过的人被战争的规则与逻辑重新塑造，着实是件可悲的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得自己原本的模样吗？那个还没经历过独立战争的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个总捧着经卷，一心四处游历，誓用手中铳械终结一切不公与纷争的人，你还记得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，伍迪，我不仅记得我的模样，更记得你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前总带着画笔，成日想着终有一天要将自己的画作留在教堂穹顶上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年，你还碰过画笔吗，伍迪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没，我有四根手指都是重新接过的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g2_mine_ruined"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目标正在向左转，速度不快，附近成员准备好实行抓捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个坐标......就在前面了，快点......雷蛇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......等、等下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"转过一条巷道，两人停下脚步，女孩孤零零的背影倏地出现在她们眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡......"},{"type":"narration","text":"听到呼唤，女孩回过头。\n见到来人后，面色露出些许喜悦，很快喜悦褪去，取而代之的是无措与仓皇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队、队长......你们也来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们收到了你的坐标，尽全力赶来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，队长......这次我闯的祸恐怕真的没法收拾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你提交的退队申请我最终批准了，严格来说，我已经不是你的队长了，杰西卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊......怎么想也是，你们现在应当是为抓捕我而来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我们是作为朋友来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来的路上我接到通讯，在能源塔的爆炸事故中里昂先生他......我不清楚你是否知情，但我觉得无论如何，你会想有人陪着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我知道的，爆炸发生前一刻，我正和里昂先生通话......谢谢、谢谢你们能来，只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗，杰西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望我们过去抱抱你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......别过来，有什么话就这样说吧......这个距离我可以听清的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停在那里别动，芙兰卡。"},{"type":"narration","text":"慌乱间，杰西卡拔出腰间的手铳，阻止芙兰卡进一步向前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......要拿铳指着我吗，杰西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起......我、我只是......芙兰卡，别这样......就让我一个人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，让我来和她说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有想去的地方吗，杰西卡？就在这一切结束后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能去哪里呢......？那几架无人机追了我一路了，你们不应该来找我的......有些事怕你们回去后说不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怕......说不清就说不清，只要我们在一起，什么也不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我怕......我很怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕那一池洁净的温水太温暖，太美好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......是什么意思......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"载具前灯的光直直射向杰西卡，数个巨大的光环将女孩禁锢在其中。\n女孩的眼睛承受不住这样强烈的光，只能一手持着铳，用另一只手臂挡住眼睛。\n不一会儿，她似乎是适应了，放下了手臂，半眯着眼看向远方向她驶来的车队。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，这些年你是怎么过的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在拓荒地的数十年里，我一直远离人群，独自带着驮兽群四处游荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不回圣城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想。你呢，你为什么不回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是个佣兵，拉特兰没我的位置。你为什么不想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦回到拉特兰，什么难受的事忘不了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可战俘营里的人死得七七八八，能记得那些事的人没几个了，总得有人记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是来到了这里，过上了那种你抗拒的平静生活，日复一日，年复一年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我没忘，我一直记得，记到今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你总有一天会带着旧账来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过我没想到，这天会来得这么晚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g2_mine_ruined"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"通讯音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目标已被包围。重复，目标已被包围。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡小姐，放下你手中的武器吧，到头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你的周围吧，你哪里也去不了，今天的闹剧结束了，一会儿雪还会更大......妈的，本来今天我能早早下班躺进被窝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然很想再道一声抱歉，但是我今天似乎说得有些太多了，再说的话......听起来就像应付话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会没事的。虽然看着阵仗很大，但是在场所有人都知道，你不会有任何事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚入职我就听说过你的名号，杰西卡小姐，每个人都说，千万别惹到你，因为你家里的律师比今天在场的佣兵还多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还能更多些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧，你也知道，自己最坏的结局不过是坐两年牢，然后被释放，重新开始过自己想要的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把扩音器放下吗？这个距离根本用不到它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，都带来了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算我求你，闭嘴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有更好的话来说服她，我当然愿意安静下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，雷蛇，你不用那么护着我的，我很清楚自己在大家心中的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，似乎从小到大我做事都没有好好想过结果是什么，因为不论做什么，都有家里人帮我兜底，所以有时难免任性了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但世事并非如此......万事万物皆有其代价。当你做下一个轻率鲁莽的决定，就要承担它的后果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡......我以为你在离队时就已经考虑好了这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，雷蛇，我说的不是今夜的事，我说的是，七年前我来到巴伦基地，走进那扇大门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时我只想在装备与应用技术部门做个装备测试员，哪里能想到未来有天真的会在战场上举起武器，把它对准另一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这就是问题所在，人们总是很轻易地拿起武器却不去思量背后所需付出的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这把小小的铳械，我用两只手就能举起它，我用一根手指就能扣动它，不到一个月，我就学会了使用它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更可怕的是......用它夺走一个人的生命，我只需要一秒钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但若要我忘记那一秒钟，却得耗尽我整整一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，这就是当时的我，多愚蠢，在拿起它前，就连未来要用它对准的是什么都没有想清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但第一颗子弹已经击出，不想清楚的话，会是一件不可饶恕的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么杰西卡小姐，你现在想清楚了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可是一直举着它，一刻也不曾放下呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你未免太自大，我什么时候说是因为过去的旧账来找你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我带着子弹来找你，是要终结我们过往的恩怨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道困在过往的人不是你吗，伍迪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你才是那个走不出来的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当佣兵当到九十多岁，除战场以外的生活，你还能适应吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，我留在战场不愿意离开，是因为战争不会结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚的战争早结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚的战争是结束了，但玻利瓦尔的战争又开始了。现在维多利亚的战火暂时平息，但余波难平......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，战争一直都在，它只是偶尔停下，然后继续爆发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你留在战场做什么呢？继续接受战火洗礼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然无法终结战争，我也只能退而求其次，试着把它的开关攥在手心里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是我成立黑钢这家佣兵公司的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真能控制得了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尝试了很多次，付出了很惨重的代价，但最终做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"值得吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只是控制着它短暂地停个几秒，便已足够让很多像你一样的人，重新拿起画笔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们在这里的行动为何不能停个几秒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想哪怕是几秒，也够很多像我这样的人，有一丝喘息的机会，不必那么狼狈地滚去拓荒地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为达维镇不是战场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g2_mine_ruined"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能放下它，因为......这是我身上唯一有力量的事物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年来，我一直觉得自己像个苍白的符号......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个符号代表的财富、家族与势力在我极力想要解决的问题前......不具有任何的意义，也起不了什么作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少靠着手中的......我完成了些任务，达成了些目标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少拿着它的我，并非一个全然无用的符号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无稽之谈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，五年了。五年里你真的有过哪次意识到，我当时挑你作为副手的原因吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是黑钢国际......什么样的厉害家伙找不到呢，杰西卡？但我还是选了你，不是因为你手中的铳械，而是因为你的眼泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼泪......队长，但我不可能用软弱的眼泪守护那些我背后站着的人啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼泪从不意味着软弱，杰西卡。B.P.R.S.的工作脏、累、危险，没人会光为了钱干这活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有那些能共情到他人痛苦的家伙，才能为一群素昧生平的人，为一个陌生的地方奋不顾身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长......在我觉得自己一无是处时，你将我带回小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我生平第一次受到赏识，我一直记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了回报你的信任，我赴汤蹈火，在所不辞，一切都是心甘情愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那不是你应该走的路......因为一个人前行不能是为了获得别人的认可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，去做你真正想做的事情，去做真正能让你感到快乐的事情。那件事，不需要别人的认可，只需要你自己内心的认同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我现在......想好好哭一场......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就哭，那就流下眼泪，没什么好顾忌的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，你的光环一直在闪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，你没看错，我是真想杀你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你口口声声说，战争无法结束，你只能控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你错了，战争可以结束，只不过你没有结束它的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争是由无数个曾遭它侵害，但依然像草一样努力活下去的普通人终结的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些被战火焚烧过的地方，是无数个在绝境中努力维系自己原来生活的普通人修补的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该死在战场上，也好过现在，变成一个张口战争闭口战争的疯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来我只想还给你一颗子弹，但现在，我是真想杀你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"一阵狂风卷起了老人的帽子，然后高高抛向空中。\n但他顾不上去看，也懒得去拾。\n他的目光直直射向对面的男人，眼睛眨也不眨，从脸颊到脖子的肌肉都紧紧绷着。\n而他的头顶上，光环在疯狂地闪烁。\n对面的男人沉默良久，缓缓叹了口气，似乎才从呼啸的风声里分辨出老人的话语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那伍迪，你清楚要杀的是谁吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"仇敌，背叛过自己的朋友，还是一个纯粹的疯子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都不是，是一个目空一切的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在他眼里，什么都可以放在天平上比较，为了他的目标，什么都是可以被牺牲的代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那你呢，你又要以什么面目对他射出子弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"匹夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在你那居高临下的注视中，失去一切，仅剩怒火的匹夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我笑，想拈画笔的手指最后要扣动扳机，想捧经卷的双手最后沾满了鲜血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"命运何其爱捉弄人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"风将克里夫的大衣鼓起，露出腰间的铳械与探向铳械的手。\n在纷乱的雪花中，他看见伍德洛做出了相同的动作。\n他恍惚记起，很多年前在拉特兰，在回宿舍的路上，有阵夜风将伍德洛的帽子吹走，飘在空中，久久不落地。\n一晃多年过去，那顶在风中的帽子终于落了下来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g2_mine_ruined"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的眼泪......你们能看见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可他们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们？谁们？"},{"type":"narration","text":"杰西卡没有回答，只是回头看向那片荒凉颓败的厂区，经历过一场爆炸后，它更是满目疮痍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你知道它以前的样子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道那座能源塔曾不间断地燃烧，为这里的居民持续不断地带去温暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道那家餐厅曾整夜不打烊，人们会围坐在桌子旁，一边喝着啤酒一边纵情高歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的冬天又漫长又寒冷，但是这里生活过的每个人都在用自己的努力与勤恳发出光热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些绚烂火热的光会铺满这里的每一寸土地，驱走冬夜的冰冷与黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们用自己熙熙攘攘的日常生活，化作热红的血液，注进这片被冬天冻僵的地块，赋予它生命与活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是些前路无望，却坚持前行的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是些被生活狠狠折磨，压弯脖颈，却依然顶着风雪继续生活的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......是些落下眼泪却从来无人在意的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的眼泪......不能代替他们表达自己的悲伤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"举起铳，女孩透过瞄具，望见了各色面孔。\n有人不解，有人不屑，有人呆怔，有人恍惚，有人暗笑，有人哀叹。\n但那些面孔都不重要，在女孩眼中，它们迅速滑入，复又迅速滑出，片刻不曾在她心里停留。\n她的脑海中另有几张面孔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g9_tent"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个在帐篷中祈祷的女孩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个在雪地中狂奔的女人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个在黑夜中拔铳的老人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个在火焰中离去的男人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我的铳械会为他们的悲伤而鸣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她抬高手腕，指向远方的天空，连开数铳，射尽了自己所有的子弹。\n弹壳夹杂在漫天飘洒的雪花中一同落地，上面的余温将积雪融化出一个个雪坑。\n铳响声在空中回荡了许久，在四周重归寂静之前，女孩的双耳捕捉到了一丝细弱的响动。\n那是她自己的泪水砸向大地的声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g11_blacksteelplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你输了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，伍迪。我选择了战争，我选择了永无止境的战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......我的人生正如一颗不回头的子弹，一次无法阻止的爆炸，是一场永不停息的进攻与防守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法终结战争，但伍迪，你可以将我终结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有最后一个奋战的士兵倒下，战争才能停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲁伯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是好久......没有听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很感激，伍迪，你还愿意再念出那个名字。除了你，没人再知道它了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克里夫闭上双眼，等待那颗子弹撕裂自己的前额。\n但在那之前，他先等到了一阵响铃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从衣袋里掏出通讯器，他看了一眼，发出嗤笑声，随后又把它塞了回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军方的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用在意，伍迪，继续就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是玻利瓦尔，还是维多利亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用管，伍迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是哥伦比亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又有战争要开始了，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会波及哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是些预兆，不一定会发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把它给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍迪，这上面很多东西对我来说不过是琐碎的日常，但对你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只会是另一段噩梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拿来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你执意要看，那请便吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这上面的事务，你死了，谁来接手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“桥夹”克里夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1036_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总会有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不该。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不该再多一个你这样的人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他把通讯器抛在地上，随后偏过铳口，将通讯器射成了筛子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能杀你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这罪还是应该你来背。"},{"type":"narration","text":"伍德洛将铳械放在地上，举起双手。\n他的背后，不断有被铳声吸引的佣兵赶来，慌乱的脚步声将他包围。\n天空中，这个夜晚的最后几朵雪花正飘然落下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g2_mine_ruined"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"带我走吧，诸位，我准备好了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩将铳械插回腰间，将手举过头顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手背过去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......手铐没有我想象中那么冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把它捂了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开前我可以和你说几句吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也正想和你道声谢，先生，谢谢你愿意听我讲这么多话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......在你之前，那样的话，有另外一个家伙也总是叨叨个不停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想他会很高兴的......你能记得他说的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你也知道他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的黑钢佣兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是个很好的小伙子，见过就很难忘记......别了，杰西卡。"},{"type":"narration","text":"佣兵轻轻拍了拍女孩的肩膀，在晨曦中扬起一片尘土，然后转身离开。\n凝视着那一小片阳光下的飞尘，杰西卡突然意识到，夜晚已经过去。\n而昨夜的大雪也在不经意间，悄然停息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪她展开双臂，将我拥入怀♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪从此她的双臂间，盛满我的家与梦♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
